==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|sworen}}, {{m|enm|isworen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|sworen}}, {{m|ang|ġesworen}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*swaran}}, {{m|gmw-pro|*giswaran}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*swaranaz}}, past participle of {{der|en|gem-pro|*swarjaną|t=to swear}}, equivalent to {{af|en|swear|-en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/swɔɹn/|a=GenAm}}
* {{IPA|en|/swɔːn/|a=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/swo(ː)ɹn/|a=rhotic,non-horse-hoarse}}
* {{IPA|en|/swoən/|a=non-rhotic,non-horse-hoarse}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-sworn.ogg|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɔː(ɹ)n|s=1}}

