{{head|en|verb form}}

# {{past participle of|en|swear|nocat=1}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Given or declared under [[oath]].
#: {{ux|en|His '''sworn''' statement convinced the judge.}}
# Bound as though by an oath.
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Tempest|II|ii|text=Swum ashore, man, like a duck. I can swim like a duck, I'll be '''sworn'''.}}
# Ardent, devout.
#: {{ux|en|a '''sworn''' foe}}
#: {{ux|en|a '''sworn''' socialist}}

